@startuml FIG-SEQ-01_调用时序图
!theme materia-outline
title 图 X-Y 调用时序
<style>
diagram {
  FontName "Noto Sans CJK SC";
  FontSize 12;
}
</style>

actor "用户" as User
participant "App" as App
participant "HAL" as HAL
participant "Driver" as Drv
User -> App: hello()
App -> HAL: hal_open()
HAL -> Drv: ioctl(HELLO_IOCTL)
Drv --> HAL: 返回数据
HAL --> App: 返回结果
App --> User: 显示
note over HAL, Drv: 需 SELinux 策略
@enduml
